I'm looking into setting up a CVS archive for the embedded Motorola
boards.. Now that I've read more about CVS, it looks like this might be
possible to just have another 'branch' for this on the Vger cvs.

Who would I talk to about getting access to the Vger CVS? I'm also not
sure this is a good idea, since my understanding is that to give access to
the PPC stuff would require full access to all the other sparc stuff. 

It also seems to me that vger itself is overworked sometimes, so setting
up a separate archive would at least not add to the load. However, I don't
think I have the bandwidth to support full anon access.

Comments anyone? (Especially from Cort, Paul, and Geert)

